f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows March to April and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 43 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. In 2025, the middle of the grids ran 204% of normal in March to April and 39% of normal in November to December. So far in 2026, February to March and March to April both came in at 17% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
